{"version":1,"headingID":"doc-hello-world","nodes":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"This walkthrough starts with one file, promotes it to a module, adds a test,\nand produces release artifacts."}]},{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"id":"doc-run-one-file"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Run one file"}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Create "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"hello.vo"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":":"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"vo"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"func greet(name string) string {\n    return \"Hello, \" + name + \"!\"\n}\n\nfunc main() {\n    println(greet(\"Volang\"))\n}\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Check, format, and run it:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo check hello.vo\nvo fmt hello.vo\nvo run hello.vo\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"The default run mode is the bytecode VM. For a longer native workload, use:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo run hello.vo --mode=jit\n"}]}]},{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"id":"doc-create-a-module-project"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Create a module project"}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Create an empty directory and initialize its identity:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"mkdir hello-app\ncd hello-app\nvo init example.com/acme/hello-app\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo init"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":" writes "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo.mod"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":"; source remains under your control. Create the source\ndirectories and put reusable logic in "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"greet/greet.vo"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":":"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"mkdir -p greet tests\n"}]}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"vo"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"package greet\n\nfunc Message(name string) string {\n    return \"Hello, \" + name + \"!\"\n}\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Add "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"main.vo"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":":"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"vo"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"package main\n\nimport \"example.com/acme/hello-app/greet\"\n\nfunc main() {\n    println(greet.Message(\"module\"))\n}\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Run the project directory:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo check .\nvo run .\n"}]}]},{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"id":"doc-add-a-test"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Add a test"}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Create "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"tests/greeting.vo"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":":"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"vo"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"package main\n\nimport \"example.com/acme/hello-app/greet\"\n\nfunc assert(condition bool, message string) {\n    if !condition {\n        panic(message)\n    }\n}\n\nfunc main() {\n    assert(greet.Message(\"Ada\") == \"Hello, Ada!\", \"greeting\")\n}\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Run the project tests in the VM and JIT:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo test --mode=vm\nvo test --mode=jit\n"}]}]},{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"id":"doc-build-native-aot"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Build Native AOT"}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo build"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":" produces a host executable by default:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo build . -o hello-app\n./hello-app\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Use "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"--kind=object"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":" for a relocatable object or "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"--target=TRIPLE"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":" for a\nsupported cross target. A custom runtime archive may be supplied with\n"},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"--runtime=PATH"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":"."}]},{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"id":"doc-build-web-bytecode"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Build Web bytecode"}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Create a verified bytecode module for the Wasm VM with:"}]},{"tag":"pre","attrs":{"data-language":"sh"},"children":[{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo build . --kind=bytecode --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -o hello-app.vob\n"}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"The "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo-web"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":" Wasm VM loads the verified bytecode and provides output, memory,\nscheduling, and supported platform services.\nFor browser applications, "},{"tag":"code","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"vo ui build"}]},{"tag":"#text","text":" assembles the bytecode, runtime, host adapter,\nassets, manifest, and deployment policy into one directory."}]},{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"id":"doc-continue"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Continue"}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Read the language tour for syntax, the modules guide before adding external\ndependencies, and the execution guide before selecting production backends."}]}]}